", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-100\">Tourist Agent</span>: You can walk through the market to see art, antiques, food, and fashion. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Is it far?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tourist Agent</span>: No, it's very close. It's about a 10-minute walk.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Are there any restaurants in the area?<br>", "time": "19000"}, {"image": "engenn4le08ob01re2img02.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-100\">Tourist Agent</span>: Yes. You can have a snack or something to drink at a local pub.  Every building has a story to tell. There are jugglers and musicians on every street. Covent Garden is also in the theater center of London. I recommend you go there.", "time": "33000"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le08ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}